What's an AOP?

1344
01:11:19.625 --> 01:11:22.041
"Acknowledgement of parentage"?

1345
01:11:25.375 --> 01:11:28.142
"Affirmation that I, Jefferson Wicks,

1346
01:11:28.166 --> 01:11:31.625
