1354
01:11:59.833 --> 01:12:04.226
Once again, the boys club closed ranks
and there I was, the loyal little idiot.

1355
01:12:04.250 --> 01:12:05.517
Trapped.

1356
01:12:05.541 --> 01:12:10.851
And I obeyed
