1389
01:13:39.958 --> 01:13:41.000
And...

1390
01:13:42.083 --> 01:13:43.708
we don't know this woman.

1391
01:13:44.708 --> 01:13:46.333
We do not know her.

1392
01:13:46.916 --> 01:13:49.541
We do not know, right, how she...

1393
01:13:51.541 --> 01:13:54.142
