His video with you is still trending.

2464
02:15:34.500 --> 02:15:35.642
Yes.

2465
02:15:35.666 --> 02:15:37.934
"Benoit Blanc 'pwned'."

2466
02:15:37.958 --> 02:15:40.875
Owned with a "P". Whatever that means.

2467
02:15:41.500 --> 02:15:43.392
We keep pushing the facts out there.

2468
02:15:43.416 --> 02:15:46.875
Martha, what really happened.
But it doesn't seem to matter.

2469
