It's an outhouse fire.

2470
02:15:52.625 --> 02:15:54.458
Such a time to be alive.

2471
02:15:55.416 --> 02:15:58.041
You're gonna be
very popular once you open.

2472
02:15:58.750 --> 02:16:00.309
